W:Resvelons nous, resvelons, amoureux;
W:Alons au bois tantost en cilir le may.
W:Et chanterons chascun un virelay
W:Pour sa dame: s'en serons plus joieux.
W:(Wake up, wake up, lovers; let us go to the woods now to gather the may, and each of us will sing a virelai for his lady, and be the happier for it.)
W:Burden: Alons ent bien tos au may. (Let's be off to the may.)
